      en: ["The largest nature park in Bulgaria, covering 1,161 square kilometers.", "Established in 1995 to protect its unique forest ecosystems.", "Home to the Pontic Rhododendron, a rare plant relic from the Tertiary period.", "The Veleka River is considered one of the cleanest rivers in Bulgaria.", "The Nestinari fire-dancing ritual is part of UNESCO's Intangible Cultural Heritage.", "Contains over 50% of Bulgaria's total vertebrate animal species."],
